        "created_at": "2023-02-28T20:44:36.542Z",
        "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/6/6c480f8c47c79dbcc5f6802de397e44956f77466.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/6c480f8c47c79dbcc5f6802de397e44956f77466\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/6c480f8c47c79dbcc5f6802de397e44956f77466_2_231x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"frTXhHUgglDyJ3Gi63TLoFijLbo\" width=\"231\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/6c480f8c47c79dbcc5f6802de397e44956f77466_2_231x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/6c480f8c47c79dbcc5f6802de397e44956f77466_2_346x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/6c480f8c47c79dbcc5f6802de397e44956f77466_2_462x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/6c480f8c47c79dbcc5f6802de397e44956f77466_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1170×2532 169 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<details>\n<summary>\nThis is how you hide them</summary>\n<p>I just let Deadline take care of his Catastrophes the first time, saving Buffer Overflow for when I was already set up (and it helped me avoid an Unnatural Disaster).</p>\n</details>\n<p>(It’s “Hide Details” under the gear)</p>\n<p>What was really nice is, La Comodora’s base power helped Fanatic use Wrathful Retribution twice!</p>",
